  "prefLabel": { "zh": "知行图领域", "en": "KnowDoGraph domains" },
  "definition": {
    "zh": "知识单元所属的领域。链上用数字编号(创世参数 [knowledge] domains),名称只在这里定义。",
    "en": "The domain a knowledge unit belongs to. On chain a domain is a number (genesis [knowledge] domains); its names are defined only here."
  },
