      "prefLabel": { "zh": "大模型应用开发", "en": "LLM application development" },
      "definition": {
        "zh": "面向想真正理解 AI 的开发者:大模型的原理、能力边界与应用开发方法。",
        "en": "For developers who want to understand AI: how large language models work, where they fail, and how to build with them."
